      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطْلِعٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  A palm-tree (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْلَةٌ</span>) <i>putting forth its</i>
